    "title": "The Jewels That Vanished",
    "bg": "castle"
   }
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "Two hundred and thirty-six years later, over in Dublin, someone else went after crown jewels. And this time, they got away with it.",
   "show": {
    "k": "map",
    "lon": -6.5,
    "lat": 53.3,
    "z0": 3,
    "z1": 4,
    "labels": [
     [
      "Dublin Castle",
      -6.27,
