  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "On Monday, the twenty-first of August, when the museum was closed, he took the Mona Lisa off the wall."
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "By most accounts he'd hidden inside overnight, though he later said he simply walked in that morning."
  },
  {
